      font-size="16px" font-weight="bold">PC 34.008Z Cross</text>
<text font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14px" fill="black" x="230" y="248">Watermeyer, Basil; Diamond Cutting 4th ed., p347</text>
<text font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14px" fill="black" x="230" y="266">Requires carving to remove material between the arms</text>
<text font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14px" fill="black" x="230" y="284">of the "cross"</text>
<text font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14px" fill="black"><tspan x="230" y="302">Angles for R.I. = 1.760</tspan>
<tspan x="230" y="320">49 facets + 12 girdles</tspan>
<tspan x="230" y="338">4-fold, mirror-image symmetry; 96 index</tspan>
<tspan x="230" y="356">L/W = 1.000  T/W = 0.277  U/W = 0.277</tspan>
<tspan x="230" y="374">P/W = 0.514 C/W = 0.232</tspan>
